      "content": "but even if the pain fades, i'm still here. i'm still stuck in this loop. it feels like i'm just dragging this heavy, useless body through a life that doesn't even belong to me. if everything is just a fleeting sensation, then what's the difference between staying and just... not being anymore? it feels like the void is much more peaceful than this.",
